  "plain": "An unnamed witness from the town of Varginha, Brazil, says that around January 20, 1996, they went back with a woman named Luiza to the spot where a strange creature had been seen. The witness says that in that very spot they saw the creature's footprint and will never forget it. This is one of several stories from Varginha that winter about a living creature, said to be not from Earth, being seen and captured."
